{"id":"abf0a0169d943327","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/086_循环证明系统_Cyclic_Proofs.md","title":"086 循环证明系统 Cyclic Proofs","display":"086_循环证明系统_Cyclic_Proofs","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-归纳公式语言\">1. 归纳公式语言</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，谓词变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PredVar=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(PredVar=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atm,\\quad pvar,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad mu.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atm,\\quad pvar,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad mu.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_Cyc\">\\(Frm_Cyc\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(atm(p)\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in PredVar\">\\(X\\in PredVar\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pvar(X)\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(pvar(X)\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in PredVar\">\\(X\\in PredVar\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(A\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mu(X,A)\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(mu(X,A)\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"2.-自由谓词变量与替换\">2. 自由谓词变量与替换</h1>\n<p>自由谓词变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FPV(atm(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad FPV(pvar(X))=\\{X\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FPV(atm(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad FPV(pvar(X))=\\{X\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FPV(and(A,B))=FPV(A)\\cup FPV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FPV(and(A,B))=FPV(A)\\cup FPV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FPV(or(A,B))=FPV(A)\\cup FPV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FPV(or(A,B))=FPV(A)\\cup FPV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FPV(mu(X,A))=FPV(A)\\setminus\\{X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FPV(mu(X,A))=FPV(A)\\setminus\\{X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>新谓词变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fresh_P(Y)\">\\(fresh_P(Y)\\)</span> 取不在有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\subseteq PredVar\">\\(Y\\subseteq PredVar\\)</span> 中的最小指标元素。</p>\n<p>捕获避免替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[X:=B]\">\\(A[X:=B]\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atm(p)[X:=B]=atm(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atm(p)[X:=B]=atm(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"pvar(Y)[X:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;Y=X,\\\\\npvar(Y),&amp;Y\\ne X,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[pvar(Y)[X:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;Y=X,\\\\\npvar(Y),&amp;Y\\ne X,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"and(A,C)[X:=B]=and(A[X:=B],C[X:=B]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[and(A,C)[X:=B]=and(A[X:=B],C[X:=B]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"or(A,C)[X:=B]=or(A[X:=B],C[X:=B]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[or(A,C)[X:=B]=or(A[X:=B],C[X:=B]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mu(Y,A)\">\\(mu(Y,A)\\)</span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=X\">\\(Y=X\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mu(Y,A)[X:=B]=mu(Y,A)\">\\(mu(Y,A)[X:=B]=mu(Y,A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\ne X\">\\(Y\\ne X\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\notin FPV(B)\">\\(Y\\notin FPV(B)\\)</span>，则结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mu(Y,A[X:=B])\">\\(mu(Y,A[X:=B])\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\ne X\">\\(Y\\ne X\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in FPV(B)\">\\(Y\\in FPV(B)\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=fresh_P(FPV(A)\\cup FPV(B)\\cup\\{X,Y\\})\">\\(Z=fresh_P(FPV(A)\\cup FPV(B)\\cup\\{X,Y\\})\\)</span>，结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mu(Z,(A[Y:=pvar(Z)])[X:=B])\">\\(mu(Z,(A[Y:=pvar(Z)])[X:=B])\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{Cyc}\">\\(\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{Cyc}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的公式对集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(mu(X,A),mu(Y,A[X:=pvar(Y)]))\\in\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{Cyc}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(mu(X,A),mu(Y,A[X:=pvar(Y)]))\\in\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{Cyc}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in PredVar\">\\(X,Y\\in PredVar\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_Cyc\">\\(A\\in Frm_Cyc\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\notin FPV(A)\\cup\\{X\\}\">\\(Y\\notin FPV(A)\\cup\\{X\\}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{Cyc}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{Cyc}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_Cyc\">\\(Frm_Cyc\\)</span> 上的等价关系集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal E_{Cyc}\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal E_{Cyc}\\)</span> 当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{Cyc}\\subseteq E\">\\(\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{Cyc}\\subseteq E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and\">\\(and\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or\">\\(or\\)</span> 在左右坐标中均保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in PredVar\">\\(X\\in PredVar\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(mu(X,A),mu(X,B))\\in E\">\\((mu(X,A),mu(X,B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E_{Cyc}\\ ((A,B)\\in E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal E_{Cyc}\\ ((A,B)\\in E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-相继式与展开\">3. 相继式与展开</h1>\n<p>上下文为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_Cyc\">\\(Frm_Cyc\\)</span> 的有限多重集。相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Seq_Cyc=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_Cyc)\\times Frm_Cyc.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Seq_Cyc=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_Cyc)\\times Frm_Cyc.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\)</span>。展开函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"unfold(mu(X,A))=A[X:=mu(X,A)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[unfold(mu(X,A))=A[X:=mu(X,A)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>进展公式谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Prog(mu(X,A),B)\\Longleftrightarrow B=unfold(mu(X,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Prog(mu(X,A),B)\\Longleftrightarrow B=unfold(mu(X,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-局部推理规则\">4. 局部推理规则</h1>\n<p>初始集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_Cyc=\\{\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow A:\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_Cyc),\\ A\\in Frm_Cyc\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_Cyc=\\{\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow A:\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_Cyc),\\ A\\in Frm_Cyc\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下局部规则中的自由参数统一量化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_Cyc),\\qquad A,B\\in Frm_Cyc,\\qquad X\\in PredVar.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_Cyc),\\qquad A,B\\in Frm_Cyc,\\qquad X\\in PredVar.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每条局部规则均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Seq_Cyc^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_Cyc\">\\(Seq_Cyc^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_Cyc\\)</span>；一元规则的前提以长度为一的前提列编码。</p>\n<p>合取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge}^C\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge}^C\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>析取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee1}^C=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee1}^C=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee2}^C=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee2}^C=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>展开规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\mu}^C\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow unfold(mu(X,A))),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow mu(X,A))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\mu}^C\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow unfold(mu(X,A))),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow mu(X,A))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总局部规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Cyc}=Rule_{\\wedge}^C\\cup Rule_{\\vee1}^C\\cup Rule_{\\vee2}^C\\cup Rule_{\\mu}^C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{Cyc}=Rule_{\\wedge}^C\\cup Rule_{\\vee1}^C\\cup Rule_{\\vee2}^C\\cup Rule_{\\mu}^C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-循环证明图\">5. 循环证明图</h1>\n<p>循环证明图是五元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G=(N,r,Prem,Back,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G=(N,r,Prem,Back,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 是有限节点集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in N\">\\(r\\in N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:N\\to Seq_Cyc\">\\(\\lambda:N\\to Seq_Cyc\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prem(n)\">\\(Prem(n)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的有限前提节点列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Back\\subseteq N\\times N\">\\(Back\\subseteq N\\times N\\)</span> 是回边关系。每个非回边前提必须由第 4 节某个规则连接到父节点。</p>\n<p>证明图类型谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GraphOK}_{Cyc}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists Prem\\,\\exists Back\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\nG=(N,r,Prem,Back,\\lambda)\n\\land N\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\n\\land r\\in N\n\\land Prem:N\\to N^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(Prem(n))\\ Prem(n)(j)\\in N\n\\land Back\\subseteq N\\times N\n\\land \\lambda:N\\to Seq_Cyc\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GraphOK}_{Cyc}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists Prem\\,\\exists Back\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\nG=(N,r,Prem,Back,\\lambda)\n\\land N\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\n\\land r\\in N\n\\land Prem:N\\to N^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(Prem(n))\\ Prem(n)(j)\\in N\n\\land Back\\subseteq N\\times N\n\\land \\lambda:N\\to Seq_Cyc\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义良构图载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc}\n=\n\\{G:\\operatorname{GraphOK}_{Cyc}(G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc}\n=\n\\{G:\\operatorname{GraphOK}_{Cyc}(G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc}\">\\(G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc}\\)</span>，由有序五元组的唯一性定义投影</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Node}_{Cyc}(G)=N_G,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Root}_{Cyc}(G)=r_G,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Node}_{Cyc}(G)=N_G,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Root}_{Cyc}(G)=r_G,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prem}_{Cyc}(G)=\\operatorname{Prem}_G,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Back}_{Cyc}(G)=\\operatorname{Back}_G,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Lab}_{Cyc}(G)=\\lambda_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prem}_{Cyc}(G)=\\operatorname{Prem}_G,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Back}_{Cyc}(G)=\\operatorname{Back}_G,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Lab}_{Cyc}(G)=\\lambda_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G=(N_G,r_G,\\operatorname{Prem}_G,\\operatorname{Back}_G,\\lambda_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G=(N_G,r_G,\\operatorname{Prem}_G,\\operatorname{Back}_G,\\lambda_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些投影满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N,\\qquad\nr_G\\in N_G,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prem}_G:N_G\\to N_G^{&lt;\\omega},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N,\\qquad\nr_G\\in N_G,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prem}_G:N_G\\to N_G^{&lt;\\omega},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Back}_G\\subseteq N_G\\times N_G,\\qquad\n\\lambda_G:N_G\\to Seq_Cyc.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Back}_G\\subseteq N_G\\times N_G,\\qquad\n\\lambda_G:N_G\\to Seq_Cyc.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>前提边关系与前提标签列为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PEdge}_G(n,m)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n))\\\n\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n)(j)=m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PEdge}_G(n,m)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n))\\\n\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n)(j)=m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PremLab}_G(n)\n=\nj\\mapsto\\lambda_G(\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n)(j)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PremLab}_G(n)\n=\nj\\mapsto\\lambda_G(\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n)(j)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-回边与踪迹\">6. 回边与踪迹</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc}\">\\(G\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc}\\)</span>，定义祖先关系\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Anc}_G(m,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Anc}_G(m,n)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在从根 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_G\">\\(r_G\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的有限节点列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(r_G=n_0,n_1,\\ldots,n_k=n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(r_G=n_0,n_1,\\ldots,n_k=n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=n_i\">\\(m=n_i\\)</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le k\">\\(i\\le k\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_{j+1}\">\\(n_{j+1}\\)</span> 属于\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}(\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n_j))\">\\(\\operatorname{rng}(\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n_j))\\)</span>。回边方向约定为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n,m)\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G\">\\((n,m)\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G\\)</span> 表示从回边源 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 指向祖先目标\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>。回边条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BackOK}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n,m\\in N_G\\bigl((n,m)\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G\\Rightarrow\n\\lambda_G(n)=\\lambda_G(m)\\wedge\\operatorname{Anc}_G(m,n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BackOK}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n,m\\in N_G\\bigl((n,m)\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G\\Rightarrow\n\\lambda_G(n)=\\lambda_G(m)\\wedge\\operatorname{Anc}_G(m,n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无限展开路径谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InfPath}_G(\\pi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\pi:\\mathbb N\\to N_G\\land \\pi(0)=r_G\\land\n\\forall i\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{PEdge}_G(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\n\\lor\n(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InfPath}_G(\\pi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\pi:\\mathbb N\\to N_G\\land \\pi(0)=r_G\\land\n\\forall i\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{PEdge}_G(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\n\\lor\n(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 无限次经过回边定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BackInf}_G(\\pi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\ \\exists i\\ge k\\\n((\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BackInf}_G(\\pi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\ \\exists i\\ge k\\\n((\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>踪迹是沿路径的公式函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb N\\to Frm_Cyc\">\\(T:\\mathbb N\\to Frm_Cyc\\)</span>。若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_G(\\pi(i))=\\Gamma_i\\Rightarrow A_i,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda_G(\\pi(i))=\\Gamma_i\\Rightarrow A_i,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则踪迹 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 跟随该路径当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trace}_G(\\pi,T)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nT:\\mathbb N\\to Frm_Cyc\\land\n\\forall i\\bigl(\n\\lambda_G(\\pi(i))=(\\Gamma_i\\Rightarrow A_i)\n\\land T(i)=A_i\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trace}_G(\\pi,T)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nT:\\mathbb N\\to Frm_Cyc\\land\n\\forall i\\bigl(\n\\lambda_G(\\pi(i))=(\\Gamma_i\\Rightarrow A_i)\n\\land T(i)=A_i\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定无限展开路径的踪迹载体定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{G}(\\pi)\n=\n\\{T:\\mathbb N\\to Frm_Cyc:\\operatorname{Trace}_{G}(\\pi,T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{G}(\\pi)\n=\n\\{T:\\mathbb N\\to Frm_Cyc:\\operatorname{Trace}_{G}(\\pi,T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>回边展开步谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BackUnfold}_{G}(\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G\n\\land\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{G}(\\pi)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BackUnfold}_{G}(\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G\n\\land\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{G}(\\pi)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>进展步谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"StepProg(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists X,C\\bigl(A=mu(X,C)\\wedge B=unfold(mu(X,C))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[StepProg(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists X,C\\bigl(A=mu(X,C)\\wedge B=unfold(mu(X,C))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则进展边谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProgressEdge}_G(n,m)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PEdge}_G(n,m)\\land\n((\\lambda_G(m)),\\lambda_G(n))\\in Rule_{\\mu}^C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProgressEdge}_G(n,m)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PEdge}_G(n,m)\\land\n((\\lambda_G(m)),\\lambda_G(n))\\in Rule_{\\mu}^C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>踪迹度量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu ht:Frm_Cyc\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mu ht:Frm_Cyc\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu ht(atm(p))=0,\\qquad \\mu ht(pvar(X))=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu ht(atm(p))=0,\\qquad \\mu ht(pvar(X))=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu ht(and(A,B))=\\mu ht(or(A,B))=\\max(\\mu ht(A),\\mu ht(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu ht(and(A,B))=\\mu ht(or(A,B))=\\max(\\mu ht(A),\\mu ht(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu ht(mu(X,A))=1+\\mu ht(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu ht(mu(X,A))=1+\\mu ht(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TraceDec}_G(\\pi,T,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Trace}_G(\\pi,T)\\land\n\\operatorname{ProgressEdge}_G(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\land\nStepProg(T(i),T(i+1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TraceDec}_G(\\pi,T,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Trace}_G(\\pi,T)\\land\n\\operatorname{ProgressEdge}_G(\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\land\nStepProg(T(i),T(i+1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全局进展条件定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Progress}_C(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall \\pi\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_G(\\pi)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\exists T\\in\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{G}(\\pi)\\,\n\\forall k\\ \\exists i\\ge k\\,\n\\operatorname{TraceDec}_G(\\pi,T,i)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Progress}_C(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall \\pi\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_G(\\pi)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\exists T\\in\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{G}(\\pi)\\,\n\\forall k\\ \\exists i\\ge k\\,\n\\operatorname{TraceDec}_G(\\pi,T,i)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-循环证明对象\">7. 循环证明对象</h1>\n<p>循环证明对象是满足下列条件的循环证明图：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>根节点为目标相继式。</li>\n<li>叶节点标签属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Init_Cyc\">\\(Init_Cyc\\)</span>，或叶节点有一条回边指向其祖先。</li>\n<li>所有非叶非回边节点的前提列与父节点标签属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge}^C\\cup Rule_{\\vee1}^C\\cup Rule_{\\vee2}^C\\cup Rule_{\\mu}^C\">\\(Rule_{\\wedge}^C\\cup Rule_{\\vee1}^C\\cup Rule_{\\vee2}^C\\cup Rule_{\\mu}^C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BackOK}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{BackOK}(G)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Progress}_C(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Progress}_C(G)\\)</span> 成立。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>节点许可谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{Cyc}(G,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n)=\\varnothing\n\\land\n(\\lambda_G(n)\\in Init_Cyc\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\in N_G\\,(n,m)\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G)\n\\bigr)\n\\lor\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\n(\\operatorname{PremLab}_G(n),\\lambda_G(n))\\in Rule_{Cyc}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{Cyc}(G,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n)=\\varnothing\n\\land\n(\\lambda_G(n)\\in Init_Cyc\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\in N_G\\,(n,m)\\in\\operatorname{Back}_G)\n\\bigr)\n\\lor\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Prem}_G(n)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\n(\\operatorname{PremLab}_G(n),\\lambda_G(n))\\in Rule_{Cyc}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化地，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CycProof}(G,\\Gamma,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{GraphOK}_{Cyc}(G)\n\\land \\operatorname{RootLab}_{Cyc}(G)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\n\\land \\operatorname{BackOK}(G)\n\\land \\operatorname{Progress}_C(G)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in N_G\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{Cyc}(G,n)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CycProof}(G,\\Gamma,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{GraphOK}_{Cyc}(G)\n\\land \\operatorname{RootLab}_{Cyc}(G)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\n\\land \\operatorname{BackOK}(G)\n\\land \\operatorname{Progress}_C(G)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in N_G\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{Cyc}(G,n)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{Cyc}(G)\n=\n\\lambda_G(r_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{Cyc}(G)\n=\n\\lambda_G(r_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{Cyc}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists G\\ \\operatorname{CycProof}(G,\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{Cyc}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists G\\ \\operatorname{CycProof}(G,\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可导闭包为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{Cyc}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in Seq_Cyc:\\vdash_{Cyc}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{Cyc}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in Seq_Cyc:\\vdash_{Cyc}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异条款\">9. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标差异为：本系统的证明对象是带回边的有限证明图，并要求每条无限路径满足由踪迹函数给出的进展条件；它不同于普通有限相继式证明树，也不同于无穷证明树。</p>\n<p>定义图参数化的无限路径关系与踪迹载体函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc}\n=\n\\{(G,\\pi):\nG\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_{G}(\\pi)\n\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc}\n=\n\\{(G,\\pi):\nG\\in\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_{G}(\\pi)\n\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc}(G,\\pi)\n=\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{G}(\\pi)\n\\qquad\n\\bigl((G,\\pi)\\in\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc}(G,\\pi)\n=\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{G}(\\pi)\n\\qquad\n\\bigl((G,\\pi)\\in\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标特征数据为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Feature}_{Cyc}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Back}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{BackOK},\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Progress}_C,\n\\operatorname{CycProof},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{Cyc}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Feature}_{Cyc}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Back}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{BackOK},\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Progress}_C,\n\\operatorname{CycProof},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{Cyc}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{Cyc}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Cyc}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Back}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{BackOK},\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Progress}_C,\n\\operatorname{CycProof},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{Cyc}\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A)\\in Seq_Cyc\\,\n\\forall G\\,\\forall\\pi\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{CycProof}(G,\\Gamma,A)\n\\land(G,\\pi)\\in\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\exists T\\in\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc}(G,\\pi)\\,\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(i\\ge k\\land\n\\operatorname{TraceDec}_{G}(\\pi,T,i)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{Cyc}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Cyc}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Back}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{BackOK},\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Progress}_C,\n\\operatorname{CycProof},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{Cyc}\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A)\\in Seq_Cyc\\,\n\\forall G\\,\\forall\\pi\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{CycProof}(G,\\Gamma,A)\n\\land(G,\\pi)\\in\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\exists T\\in\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc}(G,\\pi)\\,\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(i\\ge k\\land\n\\operatorname{TraceDec}_{G}(\\pi,T,i)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CyclicProofs}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nPredVar,\nFrm_Cyc,\nFPV,\nfresh_P,\n\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{Cyc},\n\\equiv_\\alpha,\nSeq_Cyc,\nunfold,\nInit_Cyc,\nRule_{\\wedge}^C,\nRule_{\\vee1}^C,\nRule_{\\vee2}^C,\nRule_{\\mu}^C,\nRule_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{GraphOK}_{Cyc},\n\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Node}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Root}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Prem}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Back}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Lab}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{BackOK},\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Progress}_C,\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{CycProof},\n\\vdash_{Cyc},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{Cyc},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Cyc},\n\\Delta_{Cyc}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CyclicProofs}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nPredVar,\nFrm_Cyc,\nFPV,\nfresh_P,\n\\mathsf{AlphaStep}_{Cyc},\n\\equiv_\\alpha,\nSeq_Cyc,\nunfold,\nInit_Cyc,\nRule_{\\wedge}^C,\nRule_{\\vee1}^C,\nRule_{\\vee2}^C,\nRule_{\\mu}^C,\nRule_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{GraphOK}_{Cyc},\n\\mathsf{Graph}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Node}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Root}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Prem}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Back}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Lab}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{BackOK},\n\\operatorname{InfPath}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{TraceCarrier}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{Progress}_C,\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{Cyc},\n\\operatorname{CycProof},\n\\vdash_{Cyc},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{Cyc},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Cyc},\n\\Delta_{Cyc}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含有限循环证明图、回边、展开踪迹和全局进展条件；不含无穷证明树、外部不动点模型或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-归纳公式语言","text":"1. 归纳公式语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-自由谓词变量与替换","text":"2. 自由谓词变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-相继式与展开","text":"3. 相继式与展开","level":1},{"id":"4.-局部推理规则","text":"4. 局部推理规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-循环证明图","text":"5. 循环证明图","level":1},{"id":"6.-回边与踪迹","text":"6. 回边与踪迹","level":1},{"id":"7.-循环证明对象","text":"7. 循环证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异条款","text":"9. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"PredVar=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"atm,\\quad pvar,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad mu.","display":true},{"tex":"Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop","display":false},{"tex":"atm(p)\\in Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in PredVar","display":false},{"tex":"pvar(X)\\in Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"and(A,B)\\in Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"or(A,B)\\in Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in PredVar","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"mu(X,A)\\in Frm_Cyc","display":false},{"tex":"FPV(atm(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad FPV(pvar(X))=\\{X\\},","display":true},{"tex":"FPV(and(A,B))=FPV(A)\\cup FPV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"FPV(or(A,B))=FPV(A)\\cup FPV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"FPV(mu(X,A))=FPV(A)\\setminus\\{X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"fresh_P(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\subseteq PredVar","display":false},{"tex":"A[X:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"atm(p)[X:=B]=atm(p),","display":true},{"tex":"pvar(Y)[X:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&Y=X,\\\\\npvar(Y),&Y\\ne X,\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"and(A,C)[X:=B]=and(A[X:=B],C[X:=B]),","display":true},{"tex":"or(A,C)[X:=B]=or(A[X:=B],C[X:=B]).","display":true},{"tex":"mu(Y,A)","display":false},{"tex":"Y=X",